{"version": 2, "width": 96, "height": 30, "title": "Leopold \u2014 brief it like a teammate. It conducts Claude Code."}
[0.6, "o", "\u001b[2m# Leopold \u2014 brief it like a teammate. It conducts Claude Code.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.6, "o", "\u001b[2m# Scripted walkthrough of the real flow (not a recorded model session).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.0, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.1, "o", "\u001b[36m$ /leopold-brief\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.0, "o", "\u001b[2mA debate, not a form. Big mission? The plan is drafted by TOURNAMENT \u2014\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.9, "o", "\u001b[2mthree stances (MVP-first / risk-first / user-first), judged, synthesized.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.45, "o", "\u001b[32m  wrote .leopold/{MISSION,CHARTER,GUARDRAILS,PLAN}.md\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.85, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.95, "o", "\u001b[36m$ leopold workflow\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.85, "o", "\u001b[2mThe brief compiles into a dynamic workflow \u2014 deterministically, in tested code.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.4, "o", "\u001b[32m  Compiled the brief into a dynamic workflow: 5 item(s), 2 wave(s).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.95, "o", "\u001b[32m    wave 1: i1, i2, i3        wave 2: i4, i5\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.5, "o", "\u001b[32m  script  .claude/workflows/leopold-run.js\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.05, "o", "\u001b[32m  args    .leopold/workflow-args.json\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.45, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.55, "o", "\u001b[36m$ /leopold-workflow\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.45, "o", "\u001b[2mThe plan now lives in CODE, not one growing context window. Git is LOCKED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.0, "o", "\u001b[32m  \u2014 phase: Execute\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.55, "o", "\u001b[32m  impl:i1  done \u00b7 verify panel: correctness \u2713\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.45, "o", "\u001b[2mi3 touches billing -> CRITICAL: three independent skeptics, none wrote the code.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.15, "o", "\u001b[33m  verify:i3  correctness \u2713 \u00b7 security \u2717 1 blocking \u00b7 does-it-actually-work \u2713\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.85, "o", "\u001b[33m  panel -> blocking finding returned to the worker (round 1/2)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.4, "o", "\u001b[32m  impl:i3  fixed \u00b7 verify panel: clean \u2713\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.95, "o", "\u001b[32m  \u2014 phase: Report   5/5 items done\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.35, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.25, "o", "\u001b[2mA stuck item? A root-cause panel forms hypotheses over DISJOINT evidence\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.15, "o", "\u001b[2mand hands the retry a concrete lead \u2014 no doubling down on a wrong theory.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.55, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.65, "o", "\u001b[36m$ leopold run --learn-on-finish\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[21.55, "o", "\u001b[2mThe charter learns you: the finished run is mined for recurring judgment calls.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.1, "o", "\u001b[32m  learn -> 2 charter amendment(s) proposed in .leopold/CHARTER-amendments.md\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.0, "o", "\u001b[2mIt NEVER edits the charter \u2014 you review, you fold in what sounds like you.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.4, "o", "\r\n"]
[24.2, "o", "\u001b[32m  make test: green.  Everything staged \u2014 NOTHING committed.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.8, "o", "\u001b[32m  Ready for you:  git commit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[27.0, "o", "\u001b[2mgithub.com/Jonhvmp/leopold\u001b[0m\r\n"]
